    {
      "text": "In a Refinement Path Convention bout, Fang Yuan names wild bull eyeball as the Gu refinement material he will remove from Fang Huai’s side. The audience thinks Fang Huai has already fused that crucial material into his incomplete Gu, yet Fang Yuan insists Fang Huai is still secretly hiding another wild bull eyeball.",
