        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wild bull eyeball is an important Gu refinement material. Fang Huai had prepared it during the refinement, and the refinement path killer move he meant to use to win relied on it. Without that eyeball he would lack the necessary components to defeat Fang Yuan. Forced to produce it, he takes the hidden wild bull eyeball from the fire, smashes it on the ground, scatters his Gu refinement flame, and walks away, admitting defeat.",
